  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are adept at formally leveraging your shikigami's connections.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Know the gift of the arcane petition OR gift of the earth petition OR gift of the minor deity petition OR gift of the minstrel petition</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The first \"gift\" petition you cast each day— gift of the arcane, gift of the earth, gift of the minor deity, or gift of the minstrel— has its spirit point cost set to 0.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
